##############################
#   STUDIO (Loopia)
##############################

IMAPAccount studio
Host mailcluster.loopia.se
User studio@marcocueva.com
PassCmd "pass email/studio"
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore studio-remote
Account studio

MaildirStore studio-local
Path ~/.mail/studio/
Inbox ~/.mail/studio/INBOX
Subfolders Verbatim

Channel studio
Far :studio-remote:
Near :studio-local:
Patterns "INBOX" "Sent" "Junk"
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
MaxMessages 300


