##############################
#   YAHOO — COMPATIBLE WITH 1.5.1
##############################

IMAPAccount yahoo
Host imap.mail.yahoo.com
User marco.cueva@yahoo.com
PassCmd "pass email/yahoo"
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore yahoo-remote
Account yahoo

MaildirStore yahoo-local
Path ~/.mail/yahoo/
Inbox ~/.mail/yahoo/INBOX
Subfolders Verbatim

Channel yahoo
Far :yahoo-remote:
Near :yahoo-local:
Patterns "INBOX" "Sent" "Bulk Mail"
Create Both
SyncState *
MaxMessages 300
